    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>EARLY DEVELOPMENT</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WIDEN is still in early development stages with lots of temporary art and experimental gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WIDEN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the fractured mind of Mason, an ex-military soldier haunted by past wounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After being heavily injured during the Iraq War, he finds himself in an eerie, seemingly empty city. But is it really empty?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While wandering around this city, time flies and starts to distort his perception. He encounters multiple disfigured figures speaking in cryptic riddles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together Mason's shattering story line, facing mind-bending horrors that blur the line between memory and madness. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival horror - Outsmart or fight psychological threats</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iraq War - Relive life or death combat in First person</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >School life - Stitch together disturbing memories</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Semi-Open World - Explore a haunting city and uncover its mysteries</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPERIENCE WIDEN WITH</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed &amp; stunning graphics</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive High end Sound</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gripping psychological horror that will keep you immerged</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven puzzles</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies who will prey on your fear</p></li></ul>",
